T:Brummy Hall's Schottische
% NFF Book 2013
S:collected from Paddy Dawson & Edie Dawson, Franklin Tas
S:collected by Stuart Graham & Julie Edwards
Z:transcribed by Stuart Graham & Julie Edwards
H:Paddy originally learnt this tune from Brummy Hall who, lived a few miles 
H:away. The original Part B appears to have evolved into the current Part B during
H:during WWII when Brummy Hall was absent from the district. Edie now plays the 
H:original B part as a 3rd part to the tune. -- Stuart Graham (Feb 2013)
